msgid "Schema.org: Event"
msgstr "Schema.org：事件"

msgid "The overall rating, based on a collection of reviews or ratings, of the item."
msgstr "该项的总体评级（基于评论或评级集合）。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. A description of the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的描述。"

msgid "The time when admission will commence."
msgstr "招生的开始时间。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. Date and time when the event ends."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的结束日期和时间。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The eventAttendanceMode of the event. Valid values are https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode, https://schema.org/MixedEventAttendanceMode, or https://schema.org/OnlineEventAttendanceMode."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的 eventAttendanceMode。 有效值为 https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode、https://schema.org/MixedEventAttendanceMode 或 https://schema.org/OnlineEventAttendanceMode。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The status of the event. Valid options are https://schema.org/EventCancelled, https://schema.org/EventMovedOnline, https://schema.org/EventPostponed, https://schema.org/EventRescheduled, or https://schema.org/EventScheduled."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的状态。 有效选项为 https://schema.org/EventCancelled、https://schema.org/EventMovedOnline、https://schema.org/EventPostponed、https://schema.org/EventRescheduled 或 https://schema.org/EventScheduled。"

msgid "Globally unique id of the event, usually a url."
msgstr "该事件的全局唯一标识（通常为 URL）。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The primary image for this item."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该项的主图像。"

msgid "REQUIRED BY GOOGLE. The location of the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 必需。 该事件的地点。"

msgid "REQUIRED BY GOOGLE. The name of the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 必需。 该事件的名称。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. Offers associated with the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 与该事件相关联的报价。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The organizer of the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的组织者。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The performer on the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的执行者。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The previousStartDate of the event."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 该事件的 previousStartDate。"

msgid "Reviews of this event."
msgstr "该事件的评论。"

msgid "REQUIRED BY GOOGLE. Date and time when the event starts."
msgstr "GOOGLE 必需。 该事件的开始日期和时间。"

msgid "REQUIRED. The type of event."
msgstr "必需。 该事件的类型。"

msgid "The URL of the event."
msgstr "该事件的 URL。"

